[
  {
    "id": "6b1674cb89d4ef7c",
    "text": ", we look at how to prepare and manufacture a multi-part fidget spinner using the",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "212b6fbb7c6aea28",
    "text": ", we look at how to machine a simple bottle opener out of wood and aluminum with Makera CAM and the Carvera!",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "2d403f566aa576c8",
    "text": ", we look at how to machine a multi-sided and multi-part table top game using Makera CAM and the Carvera!",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "debdbe8fda98c42c",
    "text": ", we look at how to to create a 2-sided wooden phone stand with Makera CAM and the Carvera Air!",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "4ea8033c05b257a2",
    "text": ", we look at how to to create a 3D relief out of solid brass with Makera CAM and the Carvera Air!",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "2961fb9a2caf7a1c",
    "text": ", we look at how to to create a rotation relief project for the 4th Axis with Makera CAM and the Carvera Air!",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "955cf775f1d5cad1",
    "text": ", we look at how the Trammel of Archimedes can be made shown in the Evolutionary Ellipsographs Lesson Plan",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "78b4b2b209036816",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we make a keychain out of aluminum.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "b0f710b2f85637a2",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we make a 3D knot puzzle. You can also find a step by step guide for this project on",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "d3c07717b356a72e",
    "text": "Instructables",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "ff00398ae8caa6c4",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we make a tic tac toe board game. You can also find a step by step guide for this project on",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "e094a4ee8fb38e1c",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we make a mini maze game.  You can also find a step by step guide for this project on",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "20f1705c8e8f8a54",
    "text": ", we look at how to design and fabricate a brass ring using the Carvera Air and 4th Axis Module.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "66a0ae884df59de9",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we make multi-part trophy.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "8391bff9a4841bf0",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with Fusion 360 as we create thread milling operations.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "69ec2d4ffc6482fe",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC's Laser Engraver Module with Lightburn.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "98b815e9f6693ff2",
    "text": "Part 1",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "23eaa531abd22838",
    "text": "of this series, we look at configuring the technology database in Solidworks CAM for the Carvera, while we look at how to prepare a design for manufacturing in",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "5e9b00ff6f836175",
    "text": "Part 2",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
  {
    "id": "bbaa01deaa5ab9d2",
    "text": ", we look at how to setup and use the Carvera Desktop CNC with the web-based CAM program, kiri:moto, as we fabricate a wooden jewelry box.",
    "page": "https://wiki.makera.com/en/knowledge-sharing"
  },
